      "q": "How much does Deloitte and Touche make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Deloitte and Touche has $461M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. The firm won 156 awards this fiscal year to date with an average award size of $3M, and obligations fell 31.1% year over year."
